":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"de0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0f61245-380b-4717-a948-25489d0aec08","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/HDMI\u003e","ts":"1634436798.404400","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: HDMI","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"HDMI","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/HDMI","text":"HDMI（エイチディーエムアイ、英: High-Definition Multimedia Interface; 高精細度マルチメディアインターフェース）は、主にテレビとハードディスクレコーダー、ゲーム機などの間を接続する際に用いられる、映像や音声などを1本のケーブルにまとめて送れる通信規格の一種。映像や音声などをデジタル信号で伝送する。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/HDMI_connector-male_2_sharp_PNr%C2%B00059.jpg/1200px-HDMI_connector-male_2_sharp_PNr%C2%B00059.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/HDMI","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/HDMI"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/pJ5j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9704174a-795e-4e98-b9d2-96adcb0a8106","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あれ、HDMI音通さなかったっけ","ts":"1634436781.404200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J7Vk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa347fbc-d634-467d-a228-4be8d14871b6","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"そもそもHDMIは映像のみでは","ts":"1634436716.403900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v8l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34a1cb20-db50-44c0-970c-bac8b326c0a1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"HDMIで、っていうのは、HDMIとは別にUSBの接続している?","ts":"1634435618.403100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CtDwS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10a9a652-6c1b-4850-9fcf-4bbbcaa2e814","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX"